:: Act1_Bulletin [bulletin]
<div class="bulletin-sheet">
<div class="bulletin-head"><span>РАДИО · 06:00</span><span>ДЕЙСТВИЕ I · ACT I</span></div>
<div class="bulletin-date"><<ru "ponedelnik" "ПОНЕДЕЛЬНИК">>, 19 АВГУСТА 1991</div>

The radio wakes you, not the alarm. An announcer reads slowly, as if from a document he has never seen before: Vice President Yanayev has assumed the duties of the President, "in connection with Mikhail Sergeyevich Gorbachev's inability, for health reasons, to perform his duties." <<note "gorbachev-foros">>

A State Committee on the State of Emergency (<<ru "chp" "ГКЧП">>) has been formed. A state of emergency is declared in certain areas for six months. <<note "gkchp-announcement">>

Your wife turns on the television. There is no news. There is <em>Swan Lake</em>. <<note "swan-lake">>

You put on your best suit and go to work. It does not occur to you not to.

<div class="continue"><<link "Staraya Ploshchad →">><<set $time to "09:30">><<goto "A1_Briefing">><</link>></div>
</div>


:: A1_Briefing [scene conversation]
<<if not $flags.a1Init>><<set $flags.a1Init to true>><<run State.variables.tray.indexOf("d3") === -1 && State.variables.tray.push("d3")>><</if>>
<div class="scene-body">
<p class="lead">Sector meeting room · 09:30</p>
<div class="speaker" data-who="rudin"><div class="speaker-portrait"></div><div><span class="speaker-name">Gennady Ivanovich Rudin</span><span class="speaker-role">Deputy head of sector · twenty-six years in the apparatus</span></div></div>

Every chair is full, though half the department was on holiday on Friday. No one is talking. Through the window you hear a sound you have never heard on Staraya Ploshchad: the grinding of tracks on asphalt, somewhere toward the Kremlin.

Rudin stands. He looks rested, almost happy.

<p class="say">Comrades. The State Committee has acted to save the country from chaos. It is our duty to support it. Today our sector will process outgoing <<ru "shifrotelegramma" "cipher telegrams">> to the regional Party committees, the <<ru "obkom" "obkoms">>. <<ru "srochno" "Urgently">>. Volkov, the draft is in your tray. Check it, register it, and send it down to the cipher room.</p>

His eyes rest on you for a moment longer than on anyone else.

<div class="choices"><<link "“Understood, Gennady Ivanovich. It will be done at once.” (comply eagerly)">><<run setup.adjustTrust(State.variables, "rudin", 1); setup.addPull(State.variables, "loyalty", 2)>><<set $flags.a1Brief to "eager">><<set $time to "10:15">><<goto "A1_Desk">><</link>>
<<link "Nod, and say nothing. (comply quietly)">><<run setup.addPull(State.variables, "survival", 1)>><<set $flags.a1Brief to "quiet">><<set $time to "10:15">><<goto "A1_Desk">><</link>>
<<link "“On what legal basis, Gennady Ivanovich? The President hasn't signed anything.” (ask)">><<run setup.adjustTrust(State.variables, "rudin", -1); setup.addPull(State.variables, "reform", 1); setup.addExposure(State.variables, 1)>><<set $flags.a1Brief to "questioned">><<set $time to "10:15">><<goto "A1_Desk">><</link>></div>
</div>


:: A1_Desk [scene]
<div class="scene-body">
<p class="lead">Room 412 · 19 August</p>

<<if $flags.a1Brief is "questioned">>Nobody in the meeting room looked at you as you left. Rudin said only, "We will discuss the law another time, Andrei Nikolaevich." <</if>>Your colleagues move through the corridor in pairs, speaking quietly. Somebody has closed every window on the floor.

<<if not ($docs.d3 and $docs.d3.seen)>>Rudin's draft telegram is waiting in your tray.

<div class="choices">[[Read the draft telegram|D3_Telegram]]</div><<elseif not ($docs.d4 and $docs.d4.seen)>>The registration stamp on the draft is still in front of you: 14 August. Five days before anyone in this building "learned" of the emergency. The draft was filed with Packet 7/С, the packet that was never supposed to be registered.

You need to know what else is in Packet 7/С. You can try the registry with what you know, which is the packet number and the date. <<if $trust.zaitsev gte 1 and not $flags.zaitsevPulled>>Or you could ask Zaitsev, who knows where every card in this building is kept.<</if>>

<div class="choices">[[Search the registry terminal|Terminal]]<<if $trust.zaitsev gte 1 and not $flags.zaitsevPulled>>
<<link "Go down to the archive and ask Zaitsev to pull the card">><<goto "A1_Zaitsev">><</link>><</if>><<if $tray.includes("d4")>>
[[Open Packet 7/С|D4_List]]<</if>></div><<else>>You sit with the list in front of you for a long time. Then, at 13:40, the city line rings. Not the internal phone: the outside line, which almost never rings.
<<set $time to "13:40">><<set $phone to {passage: "A1_Call_Belova", from: "City line · outside call"}>>
<div class="choices">[[Answer the phone|A1_Call_Belova]]</div><</if>>
</div>


:: A1_Zaitsev [scene conversation]
<<set $flags.zaitsevPulled to true>><<run State.variables.tray.indexOf("d4") === -1 && State.variables.tray.push("d4")>>
<div class="scene-body">
<p class="lead">The archive · 11:50</p>
<div class="speaker" data-who="zaitsev"><div class="speaker-portrait"></div><div><span class="speaker-name">Pyotr Fomich Zaitsev</span><span class="speaker-role">Archivist</span></div></div>

Zaitsev listens without interrupting. Then he takes a ring of keys from his drawer, unlocks a cabinet you have never seen open, and walks his fingers along the cards like a pianist.

<p class="say">Box twelve. Restricted.</p>

He pulls out a thin grey <<ru "papka">> and puts it in your hands. He does not let go of it at once.

<p class="say">I did not give you this, Andrei Nikolaevich. In 1953 I did not see anything either. That is why I am sixty-one years old.</p>

<div class="choices"><<link "“Спасибо, Pyotr Fomich.” (thank him)">><<run setup.adjustTrust(State.variables, "zaitsev", 1)>><<goto "A1_Desk">><</link>>
<<link "“Whatever happens, your name stays out of it. I promise.”">><<run setup.adjustTrust(State.variables, "zaitsev", 1); setup.addPull(State.variables, "survival", 1)>><<set $flags.promisedZaitsev to true>><<goto "A1_Desk">><</link>></div>
</div>


:: A1_Call_Belova [scene phone]
<<set $phone to null>>
<div class="scene-body"><div class="call">
<span class="call-header">☎ City line · 13:41</span>
<div class="speaker" data-who="belova"><div class="speaker-portrait"></div><div><span class="speaker-name">Irina Sergeyevna Belova</span><span class="speaker-role">Calling from a pay phone</span></div></div>

Traffic noise, and under it something like a crowd.

<p class="say">Andrei? It's Irina. I'm at the <<ru "bely-dom">>. There are thousands of people here, building barricades out of trolleybuses. Yeltsin came out an hour ago and climbed onto a <<ru "tank">>. He read an appeal: he called it a <<ru "putch">>, a coup, and said it's illegal. <<note "yeltsin-tank">></p>

<p class="say">What's happening inside? Everyone here is asking whether the Party planned this. Did it?</p>

You look at the list on your desk.

<div class="choices"><<link "Tell her about the draft dated 14 August.">><<run setup.adjustTrust(State.variables, "belova", 2); setup.addPull(State.variables, "reform", 2); setup.addExposure(State.variables, 1)>><<set $flags.toldBelova to true>><<if $trust.belova gte 1>><<goto "A1_Markova_Ring">><<else>><<goto "A1_Evening">><</if>><</link>>
<<link "“I don't know anything, Irina. Be careful.” (say nothing)">><<run setup.addPull(State.variables, "survival", 1)>><<if $trust.belova gte 1>><<goto "A1_Markova_Ring">><<else>><<goto "A1_Evening">><</if>><</link>>
<<link "Hang up, and report the call to Rudin.">><<run setup.adjustTrust(State.variables, "rudin", 1); setup.addPull(State.variables, "loyalty", 1); setup.adjustTrust(State.variables, "belova", -2)>><<set $flags.reportedBelova to true>><<if $trust.belova gte 1>><<goto "A1_Markova_Ring">><<else>><<goto "A1_Evening">><</if>><</link>></div>
</div></div>


:: A1_Markova_Ring [scene]
<<set $time to "16:20">><<set $phone to {passage: "A1_Call_Markova", from: "City line · unknown caller"}>>
<div class="scene-body">
<p class="lead">Room 412 · 16:20</p>

The afternoon crawls. The cipher room has sent up the confirmation: the telegrams have gone out to every region of the country. At twenty past four the city line rings again. A woman's voice you don't know asks for "Andrei Nikolaevich, Irina's friend."

<div class="choices">[[Answer the phone|A1_Call_Markova]]</div>
</div>


:: A1_Call_Markova [scene phone]
<<set $phone to null>>
<div class="scene-body"><div class="call">
<span class="call-header">☎ City line · 16:21</span>
<div class="speaker" data-who="markova"><div class="speaker-portrait"></div><div><span class="speaker-name">Lena Markova</span><span class="speaker-role">Journalist, <em>Moscow News</em></span></div></div>

<p class="say"><<ru "zdravstvuyte">>. My name is Lena Markova. I work, or worked until this morning, for <em>Moscow News</em>. The Committee has shut us down, along with most of the papers in the city. We're printing anyway. <<note "press-suspended">></p>

<p class="say">Irina says you are an honest man in a dishonest building. If there is paper that shows this was planned in advance, people need to see it. Not today. But soon.</p>

<div class="choices"><<link "“I'll meet you. Not this week. I'll call.” (agree)">><<run setup.adjustTrust(State.variables, "markova", 1); setup.addExposure(State.variables, 1)>><<set $flags.markovaContact to true>><<goto "A1_Evening">><</link>>
<<link "“You have the wrong number.” (refuse)">><<run setup.addPull(State.variables, "survival", 1)>><<goto "A1_Evening">><</link>></div>
</div></div>


:: A1_Evening [scene]
<<set $time to "21:05">>
<div class="scene-body">
<p class="lead">Room 412 · 21:05</p>

The building is half empty. Outside, the evening has the strange quiet of a city that is waiting for something. Packet 7/С is on your desk: the list, the draft, the date. In the morning it will have to be somewhere. (A carbon <<ru "kopiya">> would take ten minutes on the typewriter.)

By the rules in the circular, it should go back to the registry. By the rules of this building, it should go back to Rudin. By the rules of survival, it should go somewhere nobody else knows about.

<div class="choices"><<link "File it back in the registry, as procedure requires.">><<run setup.addPull(State.variables, "loyalty", 1); setup.setDoc(State.variables, "d4", "held", false); State.variables.tray.delete("d4")>><<set $flags.a1Decision to "filed">><<goto "A1_End">><</link>>
<<link "Lock it in your desk drawer.">><<run setup.addPull(State.variables, "survival", 1); setup.setDoc(State.variables, "d4", "held"); State.variables.tray.delete("d4"); State.variables.kept.pushUnique("d4")>><<set $flags.a1Decision to "kept">><<goto "A1_End">><</link>>
<<link "Type a carbon copy first, then file the original.">><<run setup.addPull(State.variables, "reform", 1); setup.addPull(State.variables, "survival", 1); setup.addExposure(State.variables, 1); setup.setDoc(State.variables, "d4", "copied"); State.variables.tray.delete("d4"); State.variables.kept.pushUnique("d4")>><<set $flags.a1Decision to "copied">><<goto "A1_End">><</link>></div>
</div>


:: A1_End [scene]
<div class="scene-body">
<p class="lead">Kutuzovsky Prospekt · 23:40</p>

<<if $flags.a1Decision is "filed">>You filed it. The card is back in box twelve, where anyone with a key can find it, or make it disappear.<<elseif $flags.a1Decision is "kept">>The drawer locks with a small, final click. You put the key on the same ring as your apartment key.<<else>>The carbon copy is folded inside your jacket. The original is back in box twelve. You feel the copy all the way home, like a stone.<</if>>

On the way home your trolleybus is diverted. Two streets away, people are carrying something heavy in the dark: paving stones, a door, a bench. Tomorrow is Tuesday.

<div class="continue"><<link "Tuesday, 20 August →">><<set $act to "act2">><<set $date to "20 АВГ 1991">><<set $time to "08:00">><<goto "Act2_Bulletin">><</link>></div>
</div>


:: Act2_Bulletin [bulletin]
<div class="bulletin-sheet">
<div class="bulletin-head"><span>«ЭХО МОСКВЫ» · RADIO</span><span>ДЕЙСТВИЕ II · ACT II</span></div>
<div class="bulletin-date">ВТОРНИК, 20 АВГУСТА 1991</div>

Overnight the barricades around the Russian parliament grew. Trolleybuses, concrete blocks, park benches, anything that could be dragged. By afternoon tens of thousands of people are standing in the rain around the <<ru "bely-dom">>. <<note "white-house-defense">>

The State Committee declares a curfew in Moscow from 23:00. Everyone says the storm of the White House will come tonight.

At Staraya Ploshchad the corridors are almost silent. Nobody has had any instructions since yesterday's telegrams.

<div class="continue"><<link "Go to the archive →">><<set $time to "10:30">><<goto "A2_Archive">><</link>></div>
</div>


:: A2_Archive [scene conversation]
<div class="scene-body">
<p class="lead">The archive · 20 August · 10:30</p>
<div class="speaker" data-who="zaitsev"><div class="speaker-portrait"></div><div><span class="speaker-name">Pyotr Fomich Zaitsev</span><span class="speaker-role">Archivist</span></div></div>

Zaitsev has made tea for two. He has never made tea for you before.

<p class="say">In 1953, when Beria fell, the men who kept their jobs were not the brave ones or the loyal ones. They were the ones who still had their papers when the new people arrived. In 1964 it was the same. Paper outlives everyone, Andrei Nikolaevich.</p>

<p class="say">Whatever happens at the White House tonight, the people who win will need to know where everything is. Keep your papers dry.</p>

<<if $kept.includes("d4")>>Packet 7/С is in your desk drawer upstairs.<<else>>Packet 7/С is back in box twelve, a few metres from where you are sitting. Zaitsev glances at the cabinet, then at you.<</if>>

<div class="choices"><<if $kept.includes("d4")>><<link "Keep the file as insurance. Say nothing to anyone.">><<run setup.addPull(State.variables, "survival", 2)>><<set $flags.insurance to true>><<goto "A2_Intercept">><</link>><<else>><<link "Take the file back out of box twelve and keep it.">><<run setup.addPull(State.variables, "survival", 2); setup.addExposure(State.variables, 1); setup.setDoc(State.variables, "d4", "held"); State.variables.tray.delete("d4"); State.variables.kept.pushUnique("d4")>><<set $flags.insurance to true>><<goto "A2_Intercept">><</link>><</if>>
<<link "Take the file to the press. Let the country see it.">><<goto "Stub_Witness">><</link>>
<<link "Give the file to Rudin and let the Party deal with it.">><<goto "Stub_Loyalist">><</link>></div>
</div>


:: A2_Intercept [scene]
<<if not $flags.a2Intercept>><<set $flags.a2Intercept to true>><<run State.variables.tray.pushUnique("d5")>><</if>>
<div class="scene-body">
<p class="lead">Room 412 · 20 August · 17:15</p>

Late in the afternoon Zaitsev comes up to your floor, which he never does, and leaves a sheet of flimsy paper on your desk without a word. A transcript. Someone in the special communications service owed him a favour.

<<if not ($docs.d5 and $docs.d5.seen)>><div class="choices">[[Read the transcript|D5_Intercept]]</div><<else>>You read it twice. Someone on the other side of the barricades is already planning for the morning after. They are not looking for heroes; they are looking for people who know where the files are.

The curfew begins at eleven. You wait until the floor is empty, then pick up the city line and dial the number with your finger, one hole at a time.

<div class="choices"><<link "Dial 205-41-07">><<set $time to "23:40">><<goto "A2_Call_Aide">><</link>></div><</if>>
</div>


:: A2_Call_Aide [scene phone]
<div class="scene-body"><div class="call">
<span class="call-header">☎ City line · 20 August · 23:41</span>
<div class="speaker" data-who="aide"><div class="speaker-portrait"></div><div><span class="speaker-name">“Sergei”</span><span class="speaker-role">Says only that he works “for the Russian government”</span></div></div>

The line crackles. Behind the voice there are other voices, a radio, someone shouting about armoured vehicles on the Garden Ring.

<p class="say">Staraya Ploshchad? Good. Listen carefully, I don't have much time. Tonight may go very badly. If it doesn't, in a week there will be no Central Committee. There will be a Russian government that has to run everything, and it has no idea where anything is kept.</p>

<p class="say">We need people who know the system. Not the bosses. The ones who did the actual work. If you have something that shows good faith, bring it. We'll remember who helped.</p>

<div class="choices"><<link "“I have something. I'll bring it when this is over.”">><<run setup.addPull(State.variables, "survival", 1)>><<set $flags.aideContact to true>><<goto "A2_Night">><</link>>
<<link "Hang up. This is not what you want to become.">><<goto "Stub_Witness">><</link>></div>
</div></div>


:: A2_Night [scene]
<div class="scene-body">
<p class="lead">Kutuzovsky Prospekt · night of 20–21 August</p>

You do not sleep. Around one in the morning the shortwave radio reports gunfire near the White House. In an underpass on the Garden Ring, a crowd has tried to stop a column of armoured vehicles. Three young men are dead. <<note "three-deaths">>

Your wife sits up beside you in the dark until dawn. Neither of you says anything about what you are listening for.

<div class="continue"><<link "Wednesday, 21 August →">><<goto "A2_Collapse">><</link>></div>
</div>


:: A2_Collapse [bulletin]
<div class="bulletin-sheet">
<div class="bulletin-head"><span>ТАСС · 21.08.91</span><span>ДЕЙСТВИЕ II · ACT II</span></div>
<div class="bulletin-date">СРЕДА, 21 АВГУСТА 1991</div>

There is no storm. In the morning the armoured columns begin to leave Moscow. By evening the State Committee has fallen apart. Several of its members fly to Crimea to see Gorbachev, and Gorbachev flies back to Moscow in the early hours of the next day. <<note "coup-collapse">>

Crowds celebrate outside the White House. Russian tricolour flags are everywhere.

At Staraya Ploshchad, someone on your floor is burning papers in an office sink. Nobody asks what they are.

<div class="continue"><<link "Friday, 23 August →">><<set $act to "act3">><<set $date to "23 АВГ 1991">><<set $time to "14:00">><<goto "A3_Order">><</link>></div>
</div>


:: A3_Order [scene conversation]
<div class="scene-body">
<p class="lead">Room 412 · Friday, 23 August · 14:00</p>

Today Yeltsin signed a decree suspending the Russian Communist Party. <<note "cpsu-suspended">> A crowd has gathered outside on Staraya Ploshchad, and it keeps growing, chanting. Someone has painted something on the wall by Entrance 5 that you choose not to read.

Rudin comes into your office without knocking. His tie is gone. He is carrying an empty cardboard box.

<div class="speaker" data-who="rudin"><div class="speaker-portrait"></div><div><span class="speaker-name">Gennady Ivanovich Rudin</span><span class="speaker-role">Deputy head of sector</span></div></div>

<p class="say">All special correspondence goes to the shredder. All of it, Andrei Nikolaevich, in the next hour. Box twelve, the cipher drafts, your drawer. It is a <<ru "prikaz">>, an order.</p>

<p class="say">We did nothing wrong. But they will not see it that way.</p>

<<if $kept.includes("d4")>>Packet 7/С is in your drawer. Your briefcase is under the desk.<<else>>Packet 7/С is in box twelve, and box twelve is about to be emptied.<</if>>

<div class="choices"><<link "Slip Packet 7/С into your briefcase. Shred everything else.">><<run setup.addExposure(State.variables, 1); setup.setDoc(State.variables, "d4", "held"); State.variables.tray.delete("d4"); State.variables.kept.pushUnique("d4")>><<set $flags.finalDecision to "kept">><<set $time to "16:30">><<goto "A3_Exit">><</link>>
<<link "Feed Packet 7/С into the shredder yourself.">><<goto "Stub_Loyalist">><</link>><<if $flags.markovaContact>>
<<link "Phone Lena Markova and tell her you are coming with the file.">><<goto "Stub_Witness">><</link>><</if>></div>
</div>


:: A3_Exit [scene]
<div class="scene-body">
<p class="lead">Entrance 5 · 23 August · late afternoon</p>

Late in the afternoon the order comes: everyone out. The building is to be sealed. <<note "old-square-sealed">> Staff file down the stairs with their coats over their arms. Some are carrying bags they did not arrive with. Outside, the crowd parts for you, slowly and with contempt.

Your briefcase feels as heavy as a person. A policeman at the door looks at every face.

<<if setup.resolveEnding(State.variables) is "scapegoat">>He looks at yours for a long time. Then he looks at a list.

<div class="continue"><<link "Continue →">><<goto "Stub_Scapegoat">><</link>></div><<else>>He looks at yours, and then at the next one. The doors close behind you. Someone fixes a wax <<ru "pechat">>, a seal, across the handles. The sign on the door now reads <<ru "zakryto">>.

<div class="continue"><<link "December 1991 →">><<set $act to "epilogue">><<set $date to "25 ДЕК 1991">><<set $time to "19:30">><<goto "Epilogue_Survivor">><</link>></div><</if>>
</div>


:: D1_Circular [document]
<div class="doc">
<span class="stamp stamp--violet">ВХ. № 3311 · 12.08.91</span>
<div class="doc-header"><span class="doc-org">ЦК КПСС · Общий отдел</span><span class="doc-sub">Circular · for internal use</span></div>
<div class="doc-meta"><span>№ 112-ц</span><span>09.08.1991</span><span>Copy 14 of 40</span></div>
<p class="doc-title">On the procedure for registering correspondence during the summer leave period</p>

1. During the leave period (August), all incoming correspondence is to be registered on the day of receipt without exception.

2. Documents marked <<ru "sekretno" "СЕКРЕТНО">> are to be entered in the restricted section of the <<ru "kartoteka">> and issued against signature only.

3. Deliveries <<ru "narochnym">> (by courier) are to be registered in the general manner, and the courier's name recorded.

4. Heads of sectors will ensure that the duty officer's telephone is answered at all times.

<p class="doc-sign">Head of the General Department<br>(signature)</p>
<div class="doc-footer"><em>Fictional document created for this game.</em> Point 3 matters: under the rules, nothing delivered by courier may bypass the registry.</div>
<<returnlink>>
</div>


:: D2_RoutingSlip [document]
<div class="doc">
<span class="stamp stamp--red"><<ru "sekretno" "СЕКРЕТНО">></span>
<div class="doc-header"><span class="doc-org">ЦК КПСС · Общий отдел</span><span class="doc-sub">Сопроводительный лист · routing slip</span></div>
<div class="routing-slip"><table>
<tr><th>Пакет · packet</th><td><<clue "packet-7s">>№ 7/С<</clue>></td></tr>
<tr><th>Отправитель · sender</th><td><span class="redacted">████████████</span></td></tr>
<tr><th>Получатель · recipient</th><td>т. Рудину Г. И. — лично (personally)</td></tr>
<tr><th>Доставка · delivery</th><td><<clue "by-hand">><<ru "narochnym">><</clue>> · 12.08.91 · 08:50</td></tr>
<tr><th>Рег. № · reg. no.</th><td>— <em>none</em> —</td></tr>
<tr><th>Указание · instruction</th><td>НЕ РЕГИСТРИРОВАТЬ. ВСКРЫТЬ ЛИЧНО.</td></tr>
</table></div>
<p class="doc-translation">“Do not register. To be opened personally.”</p>
<p class="doc-sign">Received: <span class="margin-note">Г. Рудин</span></p>
<div class="doc-footer"><em>Fictional document created for this game.</em> Click the underlined phrases to record them in your notebook.</div>
<<returnlink>>
</div>


:: D3_Telegram [document]
<div class="doc">
<span class="stamp stamp--red"><<ru "sov-sekretno" "СОВ. СЕКРЕТНО">></span>
<div class="doc-header"><span class="doc-org">ЦК КПСС · Секретариат</span><span class="doc-sub"><<clue "cipher-telegram">><<ru "shifrotelegramma" "Шифротелеграмма">><</clue>> · проект (draft)</span></div>
<div class="doc-meta"><span>To: first secretaries of republican Central Committees, kraikoms and <<ru "obkom" "obkoms">></span><span>Copies: 1</span></div>
<p class="doc-title">On measures in connection with the state of emergency</p>

In connection with the introduction of a <<ru "chp">> in certain areas of the USSR, Party committees are to take measures to support the State Committee on the State of Emergency.

Ensure that Communists in the soviets, the economy and the law-enforcement bodies assist in maintaining order. Do not permit meetings, strikes or the distribution of unauthorised publications. Report on the situation in your region by 18:00 Moscow time daily.

<p class="doc-sign">Secretariat of the Central Committee</p>

<div class="routing-slip"><table>
<tr><th>Рег. № · reg. no.</th><td>0417/с</td></tr>
<tr><th>Дата регистрации · registered</th><td><<clue "reg-date-14">>14.08.91<</clue>></td></tr>
<tr><th>К пакету · filed with</th><td><<clue "packet-7s">>№ 7/С<</clue>></td></tr>
</table></div>
<p class="margin-note">Отправить 19.08 в 07:00. — Р.</p>
<p class="doc-translation">Handwritten: “Send 19.08 at 07:00. — R.” This draft was registered on 14 August, five days before the State Committee announced itself.</p>
<div class="doc-footer"><em>Fictional document created for this game</em>, modeled on a real episode: <<note "secretariat-telegram">></div>
<<returnlink>>
</div>


:: D4_List [document]
<div class="doc">
<span class="stamp stamp--red"><<ru "sov-sekretno" "СОВ. СЕКРЕТНО">></span>
<span class="stamp stamp--violet">ПАКЕТ 7/С</span>
<div class="doc-header"><span class="doc-org">Перечень мероприятий</span><span class="doc-sub">List of measures · prepared 14.08.91 · copy 2</span></div>
<p class="doc-title">Measures for the first day (“Day X”)</p>

1. From 06:00, broadcast the Appeal and the Committee's statements on all central radio and television channels. Replace scheduled programming.

2. Suspend publication of all central and Moscow <<ru "gazeta" "newspapers">> except those on the attached list (Appendix 1). Seal the editorial offices of <em>Moscow News</em>, <em>Kuranty</em>, <em>Nezavisimaya Gazeta</em> … <<note "press-suspended">>

3. The Secretariat of the Central Committee to dispatch instructions to regional Party committees (draft attached, reg. 0417/с).

4. Ensure the telephone and telegraph connection of the Crimean residence is “temporarily unavailable.”

5. Persons requiring “special attention” are listed in Appendix 2. <span class="redacted">████████ ████████████ ██████ ███████████</span>

<p class="margin-note">Г.И. — список №2 уничтожить после исполнения.</p>
<p class="doc-translation">Handwritten: “G.I. — destroy list no. 2 after execution.” G.I. are Rudin's initials.</p>
<div class="doc-footer"><em>Fictional document created for this game.</em> It is modeled on the kinds of measures the State Committee actually carried out on 19 August: the broadcasts, the newspaper ban and Gorbachev's isolation. No such list from the Central Committee's General Department is known to exist.</div>
<<returnlink>>
</div>


:: D5_Intercept [document]
<div class="doc">
<span class="stamp stamp--red"><<ru "sekretno" "СЕКРЕТНО">></span>
<div class="doc-header"><span class="doc-org">Стенограмма · transcript</span><span class="doc-sub">Telephone conversation · 20.08.91 · 14:22 · city line</span></div>
<div class="doc-meta"><span>Subscriber A: male, unidentified (White House)</span><span>Subscriber B: male, unidentified</span></div>

<p><strong>A:</strong> …and when it's over, who runs the ministries? Not us. We don't know where anything is.</p>
<p><strong>B:</strong> Then we find people who do.</p>
<p><strong>A:</strong> From <em>there</em>? From Staraya Ploshchad?</p>
<p><strong>B:</strong> Not the secretaries. The clerks, the referents. They'll come to us themselves, you'll see. Give them a number. <<clue "aide-number">>205-41-07<</clue>>, ask for Sergei.</p>
<p><strong>A:</strong> And what do we tell them?</p>
<p><strong>B:</strong> That we'll remember who helped.</p>

<div class="doc-footer"><em>Fictional document created for this game.</em></div>
<<returnlink>>
</div>


:: Epilogue_Survivor [ending]
<div class="ending-card">
<span class="ru-name" lang="ru">Уцелевший</span>
<h1>The Survivor</h1>
<p class="lead-date"><strong>Moscow · 25 December 1991</strong></p>

Your new office is in a ministry of the Russian Federation, two kilometres from Staraya Ploshchad. The desk is larger. The phone is the same model. Sergei kept his word: the government did remember who helped, and you helped it find the files. Packet 7/С is in your safe. You have never shown it to anyone, and everyone who matters knows you have it.

<<if $trust.belova gte 1>>Irina Belova no longer returns your calls. You heard she is writing for one of the new papers.<<else>>You have not thought about Irina Belova in weeks.<</if>> <<if $trust.rudin gte 1>>Rudin telephoned in November. He needs a small favour, a signature on a pension document. You have not decided yet.<<else>>Rudin, they say, is unemployed and gives interviews to anyone who will listen.<</if>> <<if $flags.promisedZaitsev>>Zaitsev's name never came up. You kept that promise, at least.<<else>>Zaitsev retired in October. He sent you a postcard with no message on it.<</if>>

This evening you watch on television as Gorbachev resigns. Shortly afterwards the red flag over the Kremlin comes down, and the Russian tricolour goes up. The Soviet Union no longer exists. You are still here. <<note "gorbachev-resignation">>

<div class="concept-box"><h2>What this ending shows</h2>
<p><strong>Regime change without elite turnover.</strong> The Soviet state collapsed, but many of the people who had run it moved into the institutions that replaced it, often by trading on what they knew and held. Volkov survives because the new order needs the old order's paperwork. <<note "nomenklatura">></p>
<p>The Survivor is one of four endings. <em>The Witness</em>, <em>The Loyalist</em> and <em>The Scapegoat</em> are in development for the final version.</p></div>

<div class="choices">[[About this project|About]]
<<link "Play again from the beginning">><<run Object.assign(State.variables, setup.newGame())>><<goto "Start">><</link>></div>
</div>


:: Prologue_Bulletin [bulletin]
<div class="bulletin-sheet">
<div class="bulletin-head"><span>ТАСС · ТЕЛЕТАЙП</span><span>ПРОЛОГ · PROLOGUE</span></div>
<div class="bulletin-date">12 <<ru "avgust" "АВГУСТА">> 1991</div>

MOSCOW. Monday. A hot, quiet week in the capital. President Gorbachev is on holiday in Crimea. <<note "gorbachev-foros">>

In eight days, on 20 August, the new Union Treaty is to be signed, loosening Moscow's grip on the republics that have agreed to it. Some in the leadership call it reform. Others call it the end of the state. <<note "union-treaty">>

At the Central Committee building on Staraya Ploshchad, the summer staff work through the in-trays as they always have.

<div class="continue"><<link "Go to work →">><<set $act to "prologue">><<set $date to "12 АВГ 1991">><<set $time to "09:00">><<goto "P_Desk">><</link>></div>
</div>


:: P_Desk [scene]
<<if not $flags.pDeskInit>><<set $flags.pDeskInit to true>><<set $tray to ["d1", "d2"]>><</if>>
<div class="scene-body">
<p class="lead">Staraya Ploshchad · Entrance 5 · Room 412 · 09:00</p>

You are Andrei Nikolaevich Volkov, thirty-eight, a <<ru "referent">> in the <<ru "obshchy-otdel">> of the <<ru "tsk-kpss">>. Your department is where Party paper goes to be counted: every letter, report and decree is logged, numbered and routed. Nothing moves through this building without passing a desk like yours.

The window is open onto the courtyard. A fan turns slowly. The <<ru "vertushka">> on your desk, the government line, is silent. Half the department is on holiday.

Two items are waiting in your <<ru "vkhodyashchie">>. Open them from the tray on the left of the desk. On a small screen, the tray is further down the page.

<<if $docs.d2 and $docs.d2.seen>>One of them has been bothering you since you read it. The registry belongs to the archive, and the archive belongs to Pyotr Fomich Zaitsev.

<div class="choices"><<link "Take the routing slip down to the archive">><<set $time to "11:20">><<goto "P_Archive">><</link>></div><<else>>
<div class="choices">[[Open the circular|D1_Circular]]
[[Open the routing slip|D2_RoutingSlip]]</div><</if>>
</div>


:: P_Archive [scene conversation]
<div class="scene-body">
<p class="lead">The archive · basement level · 11:20</p>
<div class="speaker" data-who="zaitsev"><div class="speaker-portrait"></div><div><span class="speaker-name">Pyotr Fomich Zaitsev</span><span class="speaker-role">Archivist · sixty-one · has served under every Party leader since Khrushchev</span></div></div>

The <<ru "arkhiv">> smells of dust and machine oil. Zaitsev takes the routing slip without looking up, then looks up very slowly.

<p class="say">Пакет семь-эс. By courier. "Do not register." Signed for by Comrade Rudin personally.</p>

He turns the slip over, as if something might be written on the back.

<p class="say">Andrei Nikolaevich, in thirty years I have seen this instruction perhaps four times. Each time, a month later, a great many people were looking for new jobs.</p>

<div class="choices"><<link "“You've noticed it too, then, Pyotr Fomich?” (ask gently)">><<run setup.adjustTrust(State.variables, "zaitsev", 1); setup.addPull(State.variables, "survival", 1)>><<set $flags.pArchive to "tactful">><<goto "P_Terminal_Hint">><</link>>
<<link "“Who sent it? You must know where it came from.” (press him)">><<run setup.adjustTrust(State.variables, "zaitsev", -1); setup.addPull(State.variables, "reform", 1)>><<set $flags.pArchive to "pressed">><<goto "P_Terminal_Hint">><</link>>
<<link "“Forget I showed you.” (drop it)">><<run setup.addPull(State.variables, "survival", 1)>><<set $flags.pArchive to "dropped">><<goto "P_Terminal_Hint">><</link>></div>
</div>


:: P_Terminal_Hint [scene conversation]
<div class="scene-body">
<p class="lead">The archive · 11:35</p>
<div class="speaker" data-who="zaitsev"><div class="speaker-portrait"></div><div><span class="speaker-name">Pyotr Fomich Zaitsev</span><span class="speaker-role">Archivist</span></div></div>

<<if $flags.pArchive is "tactful">>Zaitsev almost smiles.

<p class="say">Noticed? I notice everything. That is why I am still here.</p><<elseif $flags.pArchive is "pressed">>His face closes like a drawer.

<p class="say">I know where the tea is kept, Andrei Nikolaevich. That is all I know.</p><<else>>He hands the slip back.

<p class="say">Wise. Very wise.</p><</if>>

He nods toward the grey cabinet in the corner: the new registry computer, which the department received last year and which almost no one trusts.

<p class="say">If it was ever entered anywhere, the machine will say so. Or it will say that you are not allowed to know. Either answer is an answer.</p>

The terminal is on the right of your desk. Try searching for the packet number from the slip, or skip it for now.

<div class="choices">[[Use the registry terminal|Terminal]]
<<link "Go up to the canteen for lunch">><<set $time to "13:10">><<goto "P_Corridor">><</link>></div>
</div>


:: P_Corridor [scene conversation]
<div class="scene-body">
<p class="lead">Canteen, fourth floor · 13:10</p>
<div class="speaker" data-who="belova"><div class="speaker-portrait"></div><div><span class="speaker-name">Irina Sergeyevna Belova</span><span class="speaker-role">Instructor, General Department · reads every newspaper in Moscow</span></div></div>

Irina Belova sets down her tray across from yours. Cabbage soup, black bread, a glass of <<ru "chay">>.

<p class="say">Have you read the treaty text? The republics will collect their own taxes. Ukraine will practically be a separate country. And still they say it saves the Union.</p>

She lowers her voice.

<p class="say">Some people upstairs say it will never be signed. They say it as if they already know.</p>

<div class="choices"><<link "“Maybe it's time the republics had their say.” (agree)">><<run setup.adjustTrust(State.variables, "belova", 1); setup.addPull(State.variables, "reform", 1)>><<goto "P_Late">><</link>>
<<link "“I just log the paperwork, Irina Sergeyevna.” (deflect)">><<run setup.addPull(State.variables, "survival", 1)>><<goto "P_Late">><</link>>
<<link "“Be careful who hears you talking like that.” (warn her)">><<run setup.adjustTrust(State.variables, "belova", -1); setup.addPull(State.variables, "loyalty", 1)>><<goto "P_Late">><</link>></div>
</div>


:: P_Late [scene]
<<set $time to "18:40">><<set $phone to {passage: "P_Call_Rudin", from: "Rudin · internal line"}>>
<div class="scene-body">
<p class="lead">Room 412 · 18:40</p>

The afternoon goes the way afternoons do: stamps, numbers, signatures. The courtyard turns gold, then grey. You are reaching for your jacket when the internal phone rings: two short rings, which means someone on this floor.

<div class="choices">[[Answer the phone|P_Call_Rudin]]</div>
</div>


:: P_Call_Rudin [scene phone]
<<set $phone to null>>
<div class="scene-body"><div class="call">
<span class="call-header">☎ Internal line · 18:41</span>
<div class="speaker" data-who="rudin"><div class="speaker-portrait"></div><div><span class="speaker-name">Gennady Ivanovich Rudin</span><span class="speaker-role">Deputy head of sector · your superior</span></div></div>

<p class="say">Andrei Nikolaevich. Still at your desk. Good, good, a conscientious man.</p>

A pause. You can hear him breathing, and somewhere behind him a door closing.

<p class="say">A packet came through today by courier. Seven-S. Did it pass through your registry?</p>

<div class="choices"><<link "“No, Gennady Ivanovich. I never saw it.” (lie)">><<run setup.addExposure(State.variables, 1)>><<set $flags.liedToRudin to true>><<goto "P_Evening">><</link>>
<<link "“I saw the routing slip. Nothing more.” (admit it)">><<run setup.adjustTrust(State.variables, "rudin", 1); setup.addPull(State.variables, "loyalty", 1)>><<set $flags.toldRudin to true>><<goto "P_Evening">><</link>>
<<link "“What's in it, if I may ask?” (ask)">><<run setup.adjustTrust(State.variables, "rudin", -1); setup.addPull(State.variables, "reform", 1); setup.addExposure(State.variables, 1)>><<set $flags.askedRudin to true>><<goto "P_Evening">><</link>></div>
</div></div>


:: P_Evening [scene]
<div class="scene-body">
<p class="lead">Home · Kutuzovsky Prospekt · evening</p>

<<if $flags.liedToRudin>>Rudin said only "Good," and hung up. You keep hearing the word on the Metro home.<<elseif $flags.toldRudin>>Rudin thanked you warmly, like an uncle, and told you to forget about it. You find that you can't.<<else>>Rudin was quiet for a long moment. Then: "Curiosity, Andrei Nikolaevich, is a young man's habit." He hung up.<</if>>

At home your wife is watching the news with the sound low. Your daughter is at the <<ru "dacha">> with her grandmother for the rest of August. On television a weather map of the Soviet Union, all fifteen republics, glows in the summer heat.

You go to bed early. The week passes. Nothing happens, and then the weekend passes too.

<div class="continue"><<link "Monday, 19 August →">><<set $act to "act1">><<set $date to "19 АВГ 1991">><<set $time to "06:00">><<goto "Act1_Bulletin">><</link>></div>
</div>


:: clues.js [script]
/* Key phrases the player can mark in documents. registryKey is typed into the terminal. */
(function () {
	'use strict';
	setup.clues = {
		'packet-7s':       { label: 'Packet 7/С — routed outside the registry', registryKey: '7/С' },
		'by-hand':         { label: 'Delivered нарочным (by courier)', registryKey: 'нарочным' },
		'reg-date-14':     { label: 'Registration date 14.08.91 — five days before the coup', registryKey: '14.08.91' },
		'cipher-telegram': { label: 'Cipher telegram to regional committees', registryKey: 'шифротелеграмма' },
		'union-treaty':    { label: 'Union Treaty — signing set for 20 August', registryKey: 'союзный договор' },
		'aide-number':     { label: 'A phone number for an aide at the White House', registryKey: '205-41-07' }
	};
}());



:: documents.js [script]
/* Documents the player can hold. All are fictional unless a note says otherwise. */
(function () {
	'use strict';
	setup.documents = {
		d1: { title: 'Circular on summer registration rules', ru: 'Циркуляр', classification: 'routine', passage: 'D1_Circular', date: '09.08.91' },
		d2: { title: 'Routing slip — Packet 7/С', ru: 'Сопроводительный лист', classification: 'secret', passage: 'D2_RoutingSlip', date: '12.08.91' },
		d3: { title: 'Draft cipher telegram to regional committees', ru: 'Шифротелеграмма (проект)', classification: 'top-secret', passage: 'D3_Telegram', date: '14.08.91' },
		d4: { title: 'Packet 7/С — List of measures', ru: 'Перечень мероприятий', classification: 'top-secret', passage: 'D4_List', date: '14.08.91' },
		d5: { title: 'Transcript of an intercepted call', ru: 'Стенограмма', classification: 'secret', passage: 'D5_Intercept', date: '20.08.91' }
	};
}());



